  REQUIREMENT (Kelleher & Lelli 2024, A&A 688 A78): hydrostatic bias 10-40% at r>1 Mpc
  with MAXIMAL external field effect; 10-100% in their no-EFE branch; 50-60% beyond 2 Mpc.
  BOTH BRANCHES ARE CARRIED BELOW. Reporting only the EFE branch would quote the
  framework-FRIENDLIEST requirement and silently soften the comparison.
  KL Sect. 5.4 place r>1 Mpc at ~R500, so R500/R200 are the radius-matched comparisons.

